#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD9750 expect=skipped domain=MH
#note "Neither MHBODSYS nor MHBDSYCD is a column: Requirements.Variables.All [--BODSYS] skips the rule, since with no body system there is nothing whose code could be missing. Discriminating for the All gate only (not for the verdict): without it the absent MHBODSYS reads as a constant missing value and the rule would run and answer noViolation instead of skipped."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset MH
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col MHSEQ    type=Num
col MHTERM   type=Char
---
S1 | MH | 001 | 1 | ASTHMA
---
